                "comment": "Great Professor. Not easy material, but well explained and he is approachable.",
                "difficulty_rating": 4,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Professor Jacobs is able to get you hooked and absolutely fascinated by land use policy, zoning and property rights law. He's very approachable, incredibly helpful and an engaging professor. The tests can be a little tricky, but if you go to class every day your grade will be fine. Despite that, I'd take another class with Jacobs immediately.",
