                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Harvey is a terrific prof.  He is knowledgeable and thoughtful about many fields and thinks about them synthetically.  He is organized and can be a bit formal.  At the same time he is very accessible and responsive to students' ideas and needs. He chooses readings carefully, assigns a substantial reading load and grades based mostly on essays.",
